OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen Tzeli Hadjidimitriou made a
OL,7,     Ftrip to a quiet Greek island
OL,8,     Fbeach, she simply wanted a rest.
OL,9,     FInstead, after two days there, her
OL,10,     Flife took on a new direction and
OL,11,     Fmeaning.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1954, thousands of people from
OL,14,     Fisolated fishing communities in
OL,15,     FNewfoundland and Labrador were
OL,16,     Frelocated to 'growth centres'.
